        <article class="ticket p-6"><span class="text-3xl">🌊</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black">留時間給港邊</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#bad2cf]">市場與東琉線碼頭、漁港緊密相連，離開室內後再理解船、潮水與漁業空間。</p></article>
        <article class="ticket p-6"><span class="text-3xl">🧊</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black">採買要顧保冷</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#bad2cf]">南部氣候溫暖，生鮮離開冷鏈後風險上升；長途攜帶宜自備保冷袋並縮短常溫時間。</p></article>
